<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN OSTEND AIRPORT 1996 CARGO TRAFFIC UP 12.6%.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN OSTEND AIRPORT 1996 CARGO TRAFFIC UP 12.6%.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's Ostend Airport said on Friday freight traffic in 1996 rose 12.6 percent to 91,768,660 kilogrammes from 81,514,272 in 1995.</p>
<p>Passenger traffic rose 12.4 percent to 90,474 from 80,532.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
